## Booking and Service Area

Our services cover Malaga, the Costa del Sol and Sevilla with no minimum order, and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. There is no fixed booking window, only availability, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed. See our [booking timeline](/blog/timeline-for-booking-wedding-rentals/) guide for more on that.

## Conclusion

An all in one wedding rental package, done honestly, means one supplier for sound, lighting, microphones and a technician, not a single rental that quietly absorbs venue, catering and decor into its marketing copy. Malaga Event Gear's [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) covers the AV side for 650 euros ex VAT. [Contact us](/contact/) to check availability for your date.

## FAQs

### What's included in an all in one wedding rental package from Malaga Event Gear?

The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a high end PA sound system for up to 80 guests, warm ambient lighting, wireless microphones for vows and speeches, transport, professional setup, a live technician on site throughout the event, and post event teardown, all for 650 euros ex VAT.

### Does the all in one package include venue, catering or furniture?

No. The Wedding Pack covers audio visual equipment only: sound, lighting, microphones and a technician. Venue, catering, furniture, decor and photography are separate trades and are not part of this package. See [What "All in One" Doesn't Cover](#what-all-in-one-doesnt-cover) above.

### Is booking one all in one package cheaper than hiring separate AV vendors?

It removes the coordination cost of managing separate suppliers, separate delivery windows and separate contacts on the day, even where the equipment itself is comparable. One quote and one team on site is the main practical benefit.

### Is a technician included in the package?

Yes. The Wedding Pack includes a live technician on site throughout the event, one of only two packages in our catalog with a technician, alongside the MICE Pack, whose technician covers up to 6 continuous hours.

### How many guests does the package support?

Up to 80 guests, sized for a villa, finca or wedding hotel. For a larger wedding, [contact us](/contact/) to discuss options.
